## 🗂️ Dataset & Cleaning Pipeline

**UCI Air Quality** (De Vito et al., 2016) — [Link](https://doi.org/10.24432/C59K5F)

- 9,357 hourly observations from an Italian monitoring station.
- Sensors paired with certified reference analyzers.

**Cleaning Steps** (fully documented in notebook):
1. Raw ingestion
2. Sentinel value handling (-200 → NaN)
3. Drop `NMHC(GT)` (>90% missing)
4. Final corpus: 9,357 rows × 12 columns

